      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "tests/workflow-decision-closure.test.ts:79-90 的 completeness checker 只检查 requiredItems 的映射，已列入 deliveredPhases 的 required phase 会直接跳过，因此缺失 phase 映射仍然通过。第 216-224 行的正例甚至固定了这个错误行为，与 Planner 明确要求每个 required phase 恰好映射一次的契约冲突。最小修复：对 requiredItems 与 requiredPhases 的并集检查映射完整性，补齐正例中的 phase 映射，并新增 delivered-but-unmapped 必须失败的反例。",
      "anchor": "sha256:9f09bd8971055c0e02f16ad6653e4779884acdd9db20c5d4b5dbe1b3842f3d99",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "现有 staged 正例传入 requiredPhases=['prototype','full-app']、deliveredPhases=['prototype','full-app']，mappings 只有 BR-REQ-1，requiredItems=['BR-REQ-1']；两个 required phase 均无映射，但 checker 返回 ok=true，测试明确要求该结果。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "tests/workflow-decision-closure.test.ts::a conserved outcome, a reasoned exclusion, and dependency order all pass",
          "tests/workflow-decision-closure.test.ts::checkHandoffCompleteness"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "WDC-S1-A1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    },
